5,0,1,talk,Servas,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us begin this journey with patience and an open heart. I believe we can find the truth if we listen to one another.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree. A quiet, observant approach is best for now. I shall be content to listen and see what patterns emerge in our conversation.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play with you all! Let's all be honest and work together to find the werewolf! I'll do my best to help!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"I agree with Jonathan. Since we have no information yet, we should focus on observing behavior and reactions. Let us see who tries to steer the narrative too early.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,May,,"Such a serious start! Let's lighten the mood a bit. I'm sure we'll have plenty of time for suspicion later. For now, why don't we just get to know each other?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"May's spirit is refreshing. However, Victoria is correct; the first few interactions often reveal the most. I am curious if anyone has a specific strategy for this game.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer to avoid rigid strategies. I believe the truth reveals itself to those who remain calm and detached. I will simply be watching.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Servas, I don't have a fancy strategy, but I think if we're all kind to each other, the werewolf will feel out of place! Does that make sense?","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"Kindness is a virtue, Yumi, but logic is our only shield. I will be looking for contradictions and those who are overly eager to blend in.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you sound like a detective! I love the intensity. I'll just be myself and see who finds me the most charming. That should be a fun test, right?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Charm can be a wonderful gift, May, but in this circle, it can also be a veil. We must all remain mindful of the masks we wear.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Indeed. The gap between the persona and the intent is where the wolf usually hides. I shall be paying close attention to those gaps.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,Masks? That sounds a bit scary! But I trust you all! I'm sure we can figure this out without any fighting.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"Trust is a luxury we cannot afford yet, Yumi. I am interested to see how the Seer handles their first piece of information tomorrow.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,May,,"@Victoria, you're so focused on the Seer! Are you perhaps hoping for a quick answer? I'm just here to enjoy the game and the company.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have established our temperaments. Let us retire for the night and see what the dawn brings us. Sleep well, everyone.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,A peaceful night to all. I look forward to seeing how our initial impressions hold up against tomorrow's reality.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Yumi,,Goodnight everyone! I hope the Seer finds something really helpful tonight! Sweet dreams!,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I shall be analyzing today's dialogue in my thoughts. Goodnight.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,May,,Nighty-night! I hope you all have wonderful dreams. See you tomorrow!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
