31,1,1,talk,Servas,,Good morning. The first night has passed. I wonder if our Seer has found a glimmer of truth to guide us through the fog.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a delicate time. To speak is to risk everything, but to stay silent is to let the wolf roam free. I am curious to see who speaks first.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Good morning! Did the Seer find anything? Please tell us if you did! I'm so curious!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I have information. I divined May last night, and she is the werewolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"What?! Victoria, that's a bold lie! I can't believe you'd try to frame me so quickly. I'm just a villager!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"This is a sudden and shocking revelation. Victoria, you have exposed yourself as the Seer immediately. That is a very courageous, if risky, move.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is indeed bold. However, we must consider if this is a genuine reveal or a strategic strike by the werewolf to eliminate a target.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no! May is the wolf? But she's so nice! Victoria, are you really sure? I don't want to vote for the wrong person!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am certain. The divination does not lie. May is the werewolf, and for the safety of the village, she must be executed today.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,"@Yumi, look at her! She's trying to manipulate you with ""certainty."" I'm the one being attacked here! Why would the Seer reveal themselves so fast? It's a trap!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"May, your panic is understandable, but Victoria's directness is compelling. Usually, a wolf would try to blend in rather than make such a definitive claim.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find the timing suspicious. If Victoria is the wolf, she has just secured a vote by claiming the Seer role. If she is the Seer, she has saved us.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so confused! @May, why would Victoria lie about you? @Victoria, are you really the Seer? I just want us to be safe!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Yumi, I am the Seer. I chose to speak now because the wolf is the most dangerous when they are allowed to build trust. We cannot wait.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, you're the only one thinking clearly! This is way too convenient. Victoria is just playing a role to get me out of the way!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"While I appreciate Jonathan's caution, the evidence provided by the Seer is the most concrete lead we have. I am inclined to trust Victoria.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I will follow the logic of the group, though I remain wary. If Victoria is lying, we lose a villager. If she is truthful, we win.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I trust Victoria! She seems very sure of herself. I'm sorry, May, but I have to vote for the safety of everyone!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The choice is clear. Let us act now before the wolf can strike again tonight.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,You're all making a huge mistake! You'll regret this when you realize I was innocent!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
